  "body": "blink-dev discussion: https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/forum/#!topic/blink-dev/G_rkd0yo2AM\r\n\r\nThree new client hint headers have been proposed. These headers expose the network quality estimates to the origin servers.  These three headers (\"rtt\", \"downlink\", \"ect\" ) should be added to the list of existing client hints in the fetch spec.\r\n\r\n/cc @yoavweiss @igrigorik ",
